=== mock RD-Agent(Q) loop (Research → Development → Co-STEER-style keep/reject) ===
real paper: Research sets goal-aligned prompts/hypotheses; Development implements;
factor–model co-optimization with iterative feedback (arXiv:2505.15155; NeurIPS 2025 only as arXiv comment — verify proceedings).
here: a formula bank stands in for LLM proposals; bandit keeps top by IS IC (danger!).
IS days=400 sealed_OOS days=120 (freeze then open once)

-- Research round 1: mock LLM proposes 3 hypotheses --
  propose mom5         IS_mean_CS_IC=-0.0022 t=-0.20 → reject_weak_IS
  propose noise_A      IS_mean_CS_IC=+0.0149 t=1.79 → keep_IS_ic>0.01
  propose rev5         IS_mean_CS_IC=+0.0022 t=0.20 → reject_weak_IS

-- Research round 2: mock LLM proposes 3 hypotheses --
  propose mom20        IS_mean_CS_IC=+0.0051 t=0.45 → reject_weak_IS
  propose slow_lag1    IS_mean_CS_IC=+0.0320 t=4.20 → keep_IS_ic>0.01
  propose vol20        IS_mean_CS_IC=+0.0049 t=0.42 → reject_weak_IS

-- Research round 3: mock LLM proposes 2 hypotheses --
  propose mom5_x_vol   IS_mean_CS_IC=-0.0009 t=-0.09 → reject_weak_IS
  propose noise_B      IS_mean_CS_IC=+0.0014 t=0.18 → reject_weak_IS

kept factors after agent loop: ['noise_A', 'slow_lag1']
